          },
          "language_variants": {
            "en": {
              "title": "Core question",
              "text_content": "The paper does not only ask how AGI should be defined. It asks whether systems that reach human-level general capability can keep scaling toward ASI."
            },
            "zh": {
              "title": "核心问题",
              "text_content": "这篇论文不只是追问 AGI 应该如何定义。它更关心已经达到人类水平通用能力的系统，是否还能继续扩展并走向 ASI。"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "seg-002",
          "content_item_id": "content-segment-002",
          "anchor_key": "p01-s002",
          "segment_type": "paragraph",
          "original_language": "en",
          "translation_status": "approved",
          "canonical_translation": {
            "language": "zh",
            "provider_key": "chatgpt-web",
            "model_name": "gpt-canonical-sample",
            "translation_version": "ct-2026-06-21-001",
            "prompt_version": "paper-translation-v1",
            "status": "approved",
            "created_at": "2026-06-21T00:00:00Z",
            "approved_at": "2026-06-21T00:10:00Z"
          },
          "language_variants": {
            "en": {
              "title": "From capability to ceiling",
              "text_content": "AGI can mean human-level general intelligence across tasks, but that does not imply intelligence has reached its ceiling. Digital systems may still gain advantages in speed, replication, coordination, and search."
            },
            "zh": {
              "title": "从能力到上限",
              "text_content": "AGI 可以表示跨任务的人类水平通用智能，但这并不意味着智能已经触及上限。数字系统仍可能在速度、复制、协同和搜索方面获得优势。"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "seg-003",
          "content_item_id": "content-segment-003",
          "anchor_key": "p01-s003",
          "segment_type": "paragraph",
          "original_language": "en",
          "translation_status": "approved",
          "canonical_translation": {
            "language": "zh",
            "provider_key": "chatgpt-web",
            "model_name": "gpt-canonical-sample",
            "translation_version": "ct-2026-06-21-001",
            "prompt_version": "paper-translation-v1",
            "status": "approved",
            "created_at": "2026-06-21T00:00:00Z",
            "approved_at": "2026-06-21T00:10:00Z"
          },
          "language_variants": {
            "en": {
              "title": "System view",
              "text_content": "From a systems view, ASI may not come from one model becoming stronger in isolation. It may emerge from models, tools, memory, retrieval, executors, and multi-agent structures working as a capability network."
            },
            "zh": {
              "title": "系统视角",
              "text_content": "从系统视角看，ASI 未必来自单个模型孤立地变强。它可能来自模型、工具、记忆、检索、执行器和多智能体结构共同形成的能力网络。"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
